to_int 7.0, -7.0, 1e9  = 7 -7 1000000000
of_rawint unsigned Int64 max (2^64 - 1)  = 0x1p+64
to_string 0.5, -2.25, 123456789, 2^40  = "0.5" "-2.25" "123456789" "1099511627776"
compare nan nan, nan 1, 1 nan  = 0 -1 1
rem 7 2  = EXN Failure("Not supported: Lm_float80.rem")
Single 0.1 (precision is a tag: not rounded)  = 0x1.999999999999ap-4, single would be 0x1.99999ap-4
of_rawfloat Single of a Double 1/3  = 0x1.5555555555555p-2
